  "sourceTitle": "Cheese-Mushroom Quiche",
  "sourceText": "Cheese-Mushroom Quiche\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 1:37pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\npound Mushrooms, sliced\n3 tablespoons Bread crumbs\n2 Onions\n1 cup Cheddar cheese, shredded\n1 Egg\n2 cups Cottage cheese, ½%% fat\nThyme, salt, pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Saute mushrooms, add crumbs. Put in quiche pan. Saute onions and put over. 2 Top with Cheddar. Combine egg and cottage cheese and put on top. Sprinkle with seasonings. Bake 45 min. at 375F.",
  "parsedSource": {
